      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "JSwetz",
        "email": "Johnswetz1982@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-10T05:13:28Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(post): Doosan DNM + Fanuc post processor (#614)\n\nAdd Doosan DNM milling post processor dialect (`doosan-dnm.cps`) based on Fanuc:\n- Through-spindle coolant (TSC) support with M88 (and option for M8)\n- 4th-axis rotary table brake unclamp (M11) and clamp (M10) on index moves\n- Fanuc AI Contour Control (AICC) high-speed smoothing G05.1 Q1 / G05.1 Q0\n- Chip conveyor start (M31) and stop (M33)\n- Renishaw Inspection Plus and standard Fanuc G31 macro-B probing\n- Doosan DNM 5700 machine definition (`assets/machines/doosan-dnm.mch`)\n- Built-in post registry and conformance suite registration with goldens\n- Unit tests in `crates/app/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs`\n- Decision record in `docs/decisions/614-doosan-dnm-post.md`\n\nChangelog: Doosan DNM + Fanuc post processor with through-spindle coolant, 4th-axis rotary clamp/unclamp, G05.1 AICC smoothing, chip conveyor, and probing (#614)\n\nFixes #614",
