      },
      "message": "align Doosan DNM post with sample program and manual citations (#614)\n\n- Update smoothing to G5.1 Q1 R<n> (default R5, range R1-R10) and cancel G5.1 Q0, cited to Fanuc 0i-F B-64604EN-2/01\n- Add Renishaw Inspection Plus optical turn-on (G65 P9832) and turn-off (G65 P9833), cited to MP700 H-2000-5142-02-A\n- Emit rotary brake clamp M10 and unclamp M11 on separate blocks, never inline with motion\n- Strictly refuse undeclared through-tool coolant and rotary lock codes by name\n- Update DNM 5700 machine spec definitions and pin refusal-by-name in tests",
