      "message": "feat(post): document DN Solutions manual MV0009OPE241_v0, drop rotary name-sniff, add sample NC\n\n- assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps: Update provenance with DN Solutions Operation Manual MV0009OPE241_v0 (Rev. v0, June 2024) Part 5 §3 (pp. 180-186), Part 8 §3 (p. 232) Alarm 2323, Part 6 §2.6 (p. 217); drop machine-name sniffing in getRotaryCodes() so clamp/unclamp requires explicit declaration or machine definition.\n\n- docs/evidence/614-dnm5700-sample.nc: Add in-tree real-world sample program from @spikeypineapple (Issue #614 comment 6764944619) confirming G5.1 Q1 R5 / G5.1 Q0, M07, and Inspection Plus syntax.\n\n- docs/decisions/614-doosan-dnm-post.md: Record exact manual citations, removal of rotary name-sniffing, and sample G-code evidence.\n\n- crates/app/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs: Assert rotary clamp refusal on both generic VMC and DNM definitions when options are omitted.",
